{"id":"15edfa8bdefed092","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-consensus.md","title":"Term consensus","display":"df-consensus — Term consensus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-consensus","aliases":["27-df-consensus"],"display":"df-consensus — Term consensus","depends_on":["[[27-df-litset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.7 Definition 2.5; §3.2.2","source_printed_pages":"92, 130–132","source_pdf_pages":"116, 154–156","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-explicit-partial-operator","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-consensus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-consensus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consensus — Term consensus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.7 Definition 2.5; §3.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"92, 130–132"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"116, 154–156"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-explicit-partial-operator"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\">\\(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L,T_M\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(T_L,T_M\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)\">\\(L=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_M)\">\\(M=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_M)\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span> 表示部分函数有定义。</p>\n<p>本节定义目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> 型部分函数符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K(L,M)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid(x_i\\in L\\land\\bar x_i\\in M)\\lor(\\bar x_i\\in L\\land x_i\\in M)\\}\\quad(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K(L,M)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid(x_i\\in L\\land\\bar x_i\\in M)\\lor(\\bar x_i\\in L\\land x_i\\in M)\\}\\quad(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in[n]}\\left\\{(L,M,i)\\mid(L,M)\\in\\{(L&#39;,M&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n^2:K(L&#39;,M&#39;)=\\{i\\}\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in[n]}\\left\\{(L,M,i)\\mid(L,M)\\in\\{(L&#39;,M&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n^2:K(L&#39;,M&#39;)=\\{i\\}\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left((T_L,T_M),T_{(L\\cup M)\\setminus\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}}\\right)\\mid(L,M,i)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left((T_L,T_M),T_{(L\\cup M)\\setminus\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}}\\right)\\mid(L,M,i)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}:\\mathrm{Term}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T_L,T_M)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsTerm}:\\mathrm{Term}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T_L,T_M)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\Longleftrightarrow|K(L,M)|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\Longleftrightarrow|K(L,M)|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>唯一互补坐标现在由前两节绑定；当有两个互补坐标时，所得合取恒假，按本目录非零项约定将该运算记为无定义。原书 Definition 2.5 本身要求所得合取非零；此部分函数与该条件一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$T_L,T_M\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n$，$L=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)$，$M=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_M)$；见 [[27-df-litset]]。$\\downarrow$ 表示部分函数有定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_L,T_M\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\mathrm{Lits}(T_M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"K(L,M)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid(x_i\\in L\\land\\bar x_i\\in M)\\lor(\\bar x_i\\in L\\land x_i\\in M)\\}\\quad(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in[n]}\\left\\{(L,M,i)\\mid(L,M)\\in\\{(L',M')\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n^2:K(L',M')=\\{i\\}\\}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left((T_L,T_M),T_{(L\\cup M)\\setminus\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}}\\right)\\mid(L,M,i)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}:\\mathrm{Term}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T_L,T_M)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}).","display":true},{"tex":"(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\Longleftrightarrow|K(L,M)|=1.","display":true}],"bytes":2053,"backlinks":[{"id":"7d5c58a3a73488b3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；DNF、项见 [[27-df-dnf]]，部分 consensus 见 [[27-df-consensus]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-consensus|df-consensus — Term consensus]]"},{"id":"46e1799ebd356635","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})$；$\\mathrm{ConsTerm}$ 的部分函数图见 [[27-df-consensus]]。$\\vee$ 是 [[27-df-boolop]] 的逐点布尔析取。"}],"outgoing":["8311e93eaac6c631"]}